<title>SINGAPORE: UOB expects similar double digit growth.</title>
<headline>UOB expects similar double digit growth.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Overseas Bank Ltd said on Thursday it expected to achieve similar double digit net profit growth in 1997.  </p>
<p>UOB chairman and chief executive officer Wee Cho Yaw told reporters at a news briefing:</p>
<p>&quot;I think our group can continue with double digit profit growth in 1997.&quot;</p>
<p>Asked by reporters to be more specific on his forecast, Wee said: &quot;I think it will be a similar growth.&quot;</p>
<p>The bank earlier reported a 13.1 percent rise in net profit to Singapore $715.5 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
